# The reverse proxy in front of Espalier (docs/guides/self-hosting.md).
# SITE_ADDRESS is the dedicated host name of Espalier; for a public name,
# Caddy obtains a publicly trusted certificate through ACME, and for
# localhost it issues one from its local CA. compose.caddy.yaml publishes
# the HTTPS port alone, on which Caddy also answers the ACME TLS-ALPN
# challenge.
{$SITE_ADDRESS} {
	tls {
		protocols tls1.2 tls1.3
	}
	header Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains"
	@trace method TRACE
	respond @trace 405
	reverse_proxy app:4000
}
